<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U to seek approval for incontinence drug.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U to seek approval for incontinence drug.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S./Swedish drugs group Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn on Thursday said it had completed clinical trials on a new drug for incontinence treatment and would apply to register the new drug in the next two months.</p>
</text>
